    },
    {
      "page_index": 6,
      "text": "Perform the following steps to quick-start the Viola carrier board:",
      "bbox": [
        85.10399627685547,
        254.076171875,
        372.43890380859375,
        265.18157958984375
      ],
      "origin": [
        85.10399627685547,
        263.0899658203125
      ],
      "size": 9.960000038146973,
      "font": "Arial",
      "flags": 0,
      "color": 0
    },
    {
      "page_index": 6,
      "text": "1. Insert a Colibri module into the SODIMM socket X1 on the Viola carrier board.",
      "bbox": [
        103.0999984741211,
        271.59619140625,
        467.9888916015625,
        282.70159912109375
      ],
      "origin": [
        103.0999984741211,
        280.6099853515625
      ],
      "size": 9.960000038146973,
      "font": "Arial",
      "flags": 0,
      "color": 0
    },
    {
      "page_index": 6,
      "text": "2. Connect the EDT Unified TFT display to the connector X7. Connect a keyboard and mouse to",
      "bbox": [
        103.0999984741211,
        289.1162109375,
        541.56884765625,
        300.22161865234375
      ],
      "origin": [
        103.0999984741211,
        298.1300048828125
      ],
      "size": 9.960000038146973,
      "font": "Arial",
      "flags": 0,
      "color": 0
    },
    {
      "page_index": 6,
      "text": "the USB ports.",
      "bbox": [
        121.0999984741211,
        300.51617431640625,
        188.93887329101562,
        311.62158203125
      ],
      "origin": [
        121.0999984741211,
        309.52996826171875
      ],
      "size": 9.960000038146973,
      "font": "Arial",
      "flags": 0,
      "color": 0
    },
    {
      "page_index": 6,
      "text": "3. Connect an external power supply (recommended: 5V +/-0.25V, 3A) to the board by the X2 (or",
      "bbox": [
        103.0999984741211,
        318.03619384765625,
        541.4230346679688,
        329.1416015625
      ],
      "origin": [
        103.0999984741211,
        327.04998779296875
      ],
      "size": 9.960000038146973,
      "font": "Arial",
      "flags": 0,
      "color": 0
    },
    {
      "page_index": 6,
      "text": "X3) connector.",
      "bbox": [
        121.0999984741211,
        329.5561828613281,
        191.69886779785156,
        340.6615905761719
      ],
      "origin": [
